OL,3,GNEWSALightning strike disrupts flights
OL,4,Aat Luton Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe airport apologised for any
OL,7,Finconvenience and said on Friday it was
OL,8,F"open and fully operational" - but
OL,9,Fadvised passengers to check flight
OL,10,Fstatus with airlines.
